### 登录相关HTTP请求示例（供手工/IDE运行）

GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/captcha

### 验证验证码
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/captcha/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "captcha_id": "<paste-from-previous>",
  "captcha_code": "ABCD"
}

### 用户名密码登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "testuser123",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "remember_me": true
}

### 获取会话状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/session
Authorization: Bearer <session-id>

### 退出登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer <session-id>

### 维护窗口模拟
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
x-simulate-time: 2025-01-05T02:30:00Z
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "testuser123",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 生成二维码与轮询
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/qrcode

GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/qrcode/<qrcode_id>/status

GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/qrcode/<qrcode_id>/status
x-dev-scan: 1

GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/qrcode/<qrcode_id>/status
x-dev-confirm: 1